From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 18:11:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] squash! storage: add an OHOS RDB backend for webstorage,
 client_storage and indexeddb

The RDB backend made `sqlite/encoding.rs` available to all engines through
a `#[path]` module in `engines/mod.rs`, but `sqlite.rs` still declared it as
its own submodule too. The file was compiled twice, which fails
`./mach clippy -- -- --deny warnings` with `clippy::duplicate_mod`. Use the
shared module from `sqlite.rs` instead.

Squash candidate: fold into the RDB backend patch at the next sync.

Validation: `./mach clippy --locked -- -- --deny warnings` (the CI lint command) now passes; `./mach test-unit -p servo-storage` 50/50; `./mach test-tidy`; `./mach check --ohos --features ohos-rdb-backend` builds the `ohos_rdb` configuration with both backends.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; found, fixed and tested by the agent)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
---
 components/storage/indexeddb/engines/sqlite.rs | 3 +--
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/components/storage/indexeddb/engines/sqlite.rs b/components/storage/indexeddb/engines/sqlite.rs
index 83101a63384..c7e234533c9 100644
--- a/components/storage/indexeddb/engines/sqlite.rs
+++ b/components/storage/indexeddb/engines/sqlite.rs
@@ -17,12 +17,11 @@ use storage_traits::indexeddb::{
 };
 
 use crate::indexeddb::IndexedDBDescription;
-use crate::indexeddb::engines::{KvsEngine, KvsTransaction};
+use crate::indexeddb::engines::{KvsEngine, KvsTransaction, encoding};
 use crate::shared::{DB_INIT_PRAGMAS, DB_PRAGMAS};
 
 mod create;
 mod database_model;
-mod encoding;
 mod object_data_model;
 mod object_store_index_model;
 mod object_store_model;
